node_modules
dist
# packages/cloud/ui/dist (the single-file dashboard) is a BUILD ARTIFACT, never
# committed. The vx-cloud build produces it: `vx run build.ui` locally, and the
# npm package + Docker image build the SPA before packaging/compiling. ui-asset.ts
# embeds whatever is on disk at compile time; from source a serve degrades to an
# API-only server (loadUiHtmlPath returns null) until the SPA is built.
# packages/cloud/src/dist is SOURCE (the distributed-execution module —
# registry/scheduler/agent-loop/submit), not build output.
!packages/cloud/src/dist/
*.tsbuildinfo
coverage
